  "body": "Big family? Blended family? A few too many vehicles? 33 Totara Road was made for the crowd. Spread across three levels and roughly 250sqm, there's room to scatter, and then still land back together on the deck by sunset. Wake up to sea views over Stanmore Bay, wander down to the beach before the sand gets hot, and settle into coastal life without the compromise. Two master suites - each with its own ensuite and sea view, its flexible layout is designed to adapt and evolve to suit your families growing needs. Our sellers sights are set on their next home, come and check this one out!\r\n\r\nFeatures You'll Love\r\n* Expansive 812sqm (more or less) fully fenced freehold section\r\n* Two generous master bedrooms, both with ensuites and captivating sea views\r\n* Single-level living option with primary master suite on the main floor\r\n* Additional master suite upstairs, ideal for multi-generational families\r\n* Elevated position capturing expansive outlooks across Stanmore Bay\r\n* Large north-facing deck, perfect for entertaining or sunset evenings\r\n* HRV system and heat pumps for year-round comfort\r\n* Carpeted internal garaging plus carport and ample off-street parking\r\n* Room for a swimming pool, additional garaging, or potential minor dwelling (subject to council approval)\r\n* Potential to further develop the ground floor (subject to council approval)\r\n* Immaculately maintained and beautifully presented throughout\r\n* Walking distance to the beach, schools, shops, and public transport\r\n\r\nMorning beach walks. Coffee at your local cafe. Space for the whole family - and then some. Large enough for blended families. Flexible enough for multi-generational living. Future-proofed with development potential. Plus with the ongoing construction of Penlink only set to enhance both accessibility and desirability to this coastal community, now is the time to buy here.\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/FZB1\r\n\r\nFlexible settlement terms available.\r\nOther agents - bring your buyers. Conjunctionals welcome.",
